  "body": "### Summary\n« Page numéro… » on an MP row (#1311, PR #1314) builds `forum2.php?config=hfr.inc&cat=prive&post=<id>&page=N`. That form matches the captured links (`page=1`, and `page=457` / `page=2` in `R13u1`), but no middle page of an MP thread has been captured. Never guess HFR behaviour (AGENTS.md §3).\n\n### Scope\n- A thread of the capture account with at least 3 pages, fetched at `page=2` (or any middle page).\n- Record the status, any redirect, and whether the page holds that page's messages only.\n- Anonymize per `docs/FIXTURES.md`.\n- The same gap is noted for `numreponse` links on later pages (`R388a`, HFR-PROTOCOL).\n\n### Consumer\n#1311 / PR #1314: « Page numéro… » on MP rows. #1311 stays open (`Refs`) until this lands.\n\n### Acceptance criteria\n- [ ] The fixture is committed and anonymized, with a HFR-PROTOCOL note.\n- [ ] #1314's MP page-number entry is checked against it.\n\n---\n_Generated by [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)_\n",
